@startuml
title Timing Diagram: Soft Fault (DRONE_STUCK) Recovery

' Forces PlantUML to stretch the X-axis for readability
scale 10 as 120 pixels

robust "Drone 1" as D1
robust "Scheduler" as SCH

@0
D1 is IDLE
SCH is LISTENING

@5
SCH is DISPATCHING
SCH -> D1 : UDP CMD (DRONE_STUCK)

@10
D1 is EN_ROUTE
SCH is LISTENING

@30
D1 is SOFT_FAULT
D1 -> SCH : UDP STATUS (SOFT_FAULT)
SCH is RECOVERY

@35
SCH is LISTENING

@60
D1 is IDLE
D1 -> SCH : UDP STATUS (IDLE)
@enduml